 "text": "---\nid: python-sldb-sldb-sldb-cli-commands-model_add-model_base_names\nsystem: sldb\nmodule: sldb.sldb.cli.commands.model_add\nqualname: model_base_names\nkind: FunctionDef\nsource_path: sldb/cli/commands/model_add.py\nsource_span: 78:87\nsource_sha256: 29a6adaf76284ef269a47a1ce4f4861afc83706608a55f6c6e60b48fe36010db\narchitecture_spec: docs/architecture/spec2viz/python-ast.yml; sha256=cece0196cfdf01c39315c3221d5fbe10e2953377809b62cfa800c0463d2146fd\ntags: []\nprovenance: python-ast:python:sldb.sldb.cli.commands.model_add:model_base_names; contract-sha256:3904ea81476a042b897023fabfb8e8d52b48367bb01617d5d26c2d427e079099\n---\n\n# model_base_names\n\n## Signature\n\nmodel_base_names(model_type: type)\n\n## Docstring\n\nNames of the StructuredNLDoc bases above this model, nearest first.\n\nRecorded so `st.{Base+}` families and `model <= Base` filters are legible from the\nstore index without importing the class.\n\n## Imports\n\n[\"__future__\", \"inspect\", \"pathlib\", \"sldb.cli.model_utils\", \"sldb.cli.store_context\", \"sldb.core.exceptions\", \"sldb.store.hashing\", \"sldb.store.io\", \"sldb.store.layout\", \"sldb.store.models\", \"sldb.store.ops\", \"sldb.store.semantic\", \"sldb.store.semantic_tags\", \"typing\"]\n\n## Purpose\n\nNot documented.\n\n## Architecture\n\nNot documented.",
